# CODEOWNERS — Control-plane authenticity gate
#
# Purpose: prevent single-PR policy RCE on the agent+skill+gate system.
# Paths listed here require review from the named owner before merge.
# See /root/.claude/plans/declarative-riding-shamir.md BLOCKER-9 (Round 3, v3).
#
# Rule ordering: last matching rule wins per GitHub's CODEOWNERS semantics.

# ── Agent control plane ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Modifying any of these paths can alter the behaviour of 22+ review agents.
# A poisoned _shared/ fragment propagates to every agent via @-include.
.claude/agents/                  @Okan-wqm
.claude/agents-enterprise-v2/    @Okan-wqm
.claude/test-agents/             @Okan-wqm
.claude/knowledge/               @Okan-wqm
.claude/skills/                  @Okan-wqm

# ── Enforcement gate configuration ────────────────────────────────────
# Allowlists, rule manifests, and boundary carve-outs must not drift silently.
.claude/allowlists/              @Okan-wqm
.claude/gates/                   @Okan-wqm
tools/gates/                     @Okan-wqm

# ── CI/CD workflows ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Workflow tampering bypasses every gate. Required to land with signed commits.
.github/workflows/               @Okan-wqm
.github/CODEOWNERS               @Okan-wqm
.github/dependabot.yml           @Okan-wqm

# ── Finding registry + audit trail ────────────────────────────────────
# Direct edits to findings.jsonl are a tamper vector; must be gated.
docs/reviews/_registry/          @Okan-wqm
docs/reviews/overrides/          @Okan-wqm

# ── Invariant test suite ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Constants file is the single source of truth for schema-owning-services
# allowlist; edits cascade to adoption-invariants + provision-tenant skill.
tests/invariants/_constants.ts   @Okan-wqm
tests/invariants/                @Okan-wqm

# ── Architectural Decision Records ────────────────────────────────────
# ADRs carry load-bearing invariants (schema ownership, NATS identity, etc.).
docs/adr/                        @Okan-wqm

# ── CLAUDE.md ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Session-start context for every review — must not drift unnoticed.
CLAUDE.md                        @Okan-wqm
